  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Women&#x2019;s Political participation in foundational political institutions and frameworks in Thailand</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to address conditions undermining women&#x2019;s political participation in Thailand, including a lack of gender-disaggregated data in elections, a limited focus on gender equality in preparations for redrafting the Constitution, and low awareness and uptake of measures to prevent bullying and sexual harassment at Parliament.</narrative>
  </description>
